# scripts/test/image.env.fixture — the image.env regression.sh runs against.
#
# The suite resets image.env from this file before every scenario, so the
# assertions read fixed values instead of whatever a developer last edited
# into their own (gitignored) image.env — and so a fresh clone, which has
# no image.env at all, can run the suite offline.
#
# Rules for this file:
#   - Never put a secret in it. It is committed.
#   - Only UPSTREAM_REF and VENDOR. Scenarios that need HARBOR_*,
#     ARTIFACTORY_* or REGISTRY_KIND append their own lines, and several
#     assert the failure you get when those are absent.
#   - Renovate must not bump the tag: the scenarios match "1.25.3-alpine"
#     literally. renovate.json's fileMatch covers image.env and
#     image.env.example only, so the .fixture suffix keeps it out.
UPSTREAM_REF="docker.io/library/nginx:1.25.3-alpine"
VENDOR="example.com"
